        "original_id": "ffebe114-ad47-5be1-9ed0-17d1ad0bd88f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Special Operations Command, Jaeger Corps, Frogman Corps, Danish Defence, Royal Danish Army\n- Places: Aalborg Air Base\n- Concepts: special operations forces, command structure\n\nFacts:\n- Special Operations Command was established in 2014 to unite the Jaeger Corps and the Frogman Corps under one command.\n- Special Operations Command is based at Aalborg Air Base.\n- The Jaeger Corps, or Jægerkorpset, is an elite special operations force of the Danish Defence.\n- The Jaeger Corps is part of Special Operations Command.\n- The Jaeger Corps was formerly part of the Royal Danish Army.\n- The Jaeger Corps is based at Aalborg Air Base.",
